  "rationales": [
    "myong=experience and 'gyur=bring isolate two independently attested lexical contributions while leaving one/an unclaimed.",
    "dkar gnag is a master-attested color compound and retains both meaningful unique tighter children; each parent has its own English white and black.",
    "'gro ba=birth is supported by the actual desire-realm rebirth clause and complete glossary birth/type of birth evidence; the curated living-being gloss belongs to a different context and is not forced onto this one.",
    "zer=claim and final 'dod=assert are reporting predicates; they cross into their clause openings through explicit English ordering.",
    "All six las positions are distinguished: first/third/fourth/sixth are deed nouns, second is omitted/pronominalized, fifth is ablative from."
  ],
  "omissions": [
    "gngsde pa omitted as malformed/uncertain source; no mid-syllable extraction or accidental attachment to first groups.",
    "rig appears once while English repeats understood in both first-alternative clauses; no arbitrarily selected dictionary occurrence is asserted.",
    "Second nominal las is represented pronominally in 'And those'; omitted rather than mapping deeds to an unrelated occurrence.",
    "First gnyis ka is rendered by two and explanatory both; only two is paired. The second gnyis ka maps to the final both.",
    "path of is supplied with seeing; mthong claims seeing only. Those kinds of/ones/articles/one and other implicit participants remain unwrapped.",
    "Genitives, nominalizers, ni, zhes, go/do, and unpaired connective dang carry syntax/fusion, not proven independent null exponents.",
    "We turn next ... possesses them and the following *********72 heading have no corresponding Tibetan here. They are preserved as source English; following-heading class is not refiled."
